# MODULE general program counter interpreter with checked growing guest tape
# PURPOSE execute all eight guest instructions including arbitrary nonzero loops
# INPUT unsigned one byte source length followed by exact source bytes
# INPUT unsigned one byte guest fuel then unsigned one byte logical cell budget
# INPUT remaining raw bytes are guest input subject to external closure authority
# OUTPUT raw guest output followed by exactly one diagnostic status byte
# TAPE source records start at outer cell thirty two with three cells per record
# TAPE guest tape records start at outer cell nine hundred with three cells per record
# PROFILE modulo byte cells and original guest command fuel before effects
# PROFILE bracket preflight precedes every guest instruction and output
# LIMITATION single record source and fuel use one byte counters
# LIMITATION one byte guest budget and physical host closure is out of scope
# LIMITATION status byte is development only and not a framed result authority
# LIMITATION absent complete host length guarantees source bytes may be truncated
# END header

